25| Day 3, morning. Repeat Steps 23 and 24.
26| Day 4, morning. Repeat Steps 23 and 24.
27| Day 5. Assess morphological changes and assay for DE markers by FACS and/or RT-PCR (Box 1). Morphology of cells should be as shown in Figure 2.
