29| Prepare anterior foregut endoderm (AFE) medium by adding FGF2 $(500~\mathrm{{ng/ml})}$ and SHH $\cdot50~\mathrm{ng/ml})$ to prewarmed dif ferentiation basal medium.
$\blacktriangle$ CRITICAL STEP AFE medium must be freshly made with every use.
