Stage 3a, differentiation to lung progenitors $0$ TIMING 5 d
41| Prepare stage 3a medium by adding FGF7 $(50\mathrm{\ng/ml})$ ), FGF10 $(50\mathrm{\ng/ml})$ and BMP4 $(5\ \mathrm{ng/ml})$ ) to differentiation basal medium.
